====================================options=====================================
parsers: ["scss"]
                                                      printWidth: 80 (default) |
=====================================input======================================
@use "sass:math";
// Multiplied by 1e339 so Sass's serialization doesn't remove the precision.
// But 1e339 is too big for a double, so we multiply it multiple times.
a {b: math.$min-number * 1e300 * 1e39}

=====================================output=====================================
@use "sass:math";
// Multiplied by 1e339 so Sass's serialization doesn't remove the precision.
// But 1e339 is too big for a double, so we multiply it multiple times.
