// or square brackets.
@media (1 < 2 or false = width) {a {b: c}}

=====================================output=====================================
// Even though \`1 < 2\` here isn't syntactically at the top-level, because \`<\`
// binds more tightly than \`or\`, it's disallowed because it's not in parentheses
// or square brackets.
